{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:58e91dcdcec6ba4f758d31b67e7b46ff975d47d9b34a7bd0284319e4c5c42c0c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9be00984f585bbcd0cf2e01bb6eae3fc815ebec7800ee48dcc69f48fa6618ebb",
      "text": "炽热的相遇！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77b7efb27c44a294691e4509e6c40ba4345a44f88a5c9b6209f2e04075f5e349",
      "text": "遇见制作人后，\n朱雀和玄武决定参加315 Production的试镜。\n为了合格，两人向小弟借了偶像的\n演唱会DVD，开始学习起来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_a:cmd-000015:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_a:cmd-000015:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9be00984f585bbcd0cf2e01bb6eae3fc815ebec7800ee48dcc69f48fa6618ebb",
      "text": "炽热的相遇！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_a:cmd-000017:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:672c7b116f6bf8211e77706a3007dfc6d7167c9ce38b9bb664668b2ed9faef6a",
      "text": "樱绚高中·天台",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f882ed5d2be0b772b4357717e157590c15ec0028f136f1c606e34dea76160757",
      "text": "朱雀先生、玄武先生。\n你们要的那东西，我带来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5894b35e6b7d9e1e77f2d0df4ea058d692bf26fcba66046d57088d32feb51f98",
      "text": "听说这是现在市面上\n最新最炸裂的货！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0db99f74b0b8f729ac82f7eb161255a1bafc1ce85bdace90baa701dfa0c6d9a",
      "text": "嚯，这就是偶像的演唱会DVD啊。\n谢啦！找你帮忙果然找对了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef50eb6e821a3426970347461357e73d2b98182970a112803d80c1862711fbf5",
      "text": "同样的东西有两套？\n特意准备的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5aaeee8581b155a19b391a74bf549795c797c446c6007a0eadc790314004b1c4",
      "text": "我其实也不太懂……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78fe4a913d16e22e6990ea096385a12469ca7b6f35fa783ac5390463fd1da845",
      "text": "我姐说，\n一份用来观赏，一份用来传教。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24f4e39d6454e5bf486d8fc3c78227acfdc858f4f4f723d9c88f7121bbccff76",
      "text": "也就是说，把观赏用的也借给我们了吗。\n特意借出来真是不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cad555ede0414cbb9be9b84f52ac320ed3bd3e85bbbe5842ebd4d24c77b541ae",
      "text": "哪里！她说只要是为了发展粉丝，\n借多少次都没问题！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ecd11d2a8882632d970eb33a1b7f850a997bd34cf4fcb92462b927c9d4c0342",
      "text": "那可帮大忙了！\n替我跟她说一声，回头我去道谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_a:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:652f1c101b331c1d3d6708a5967bff15b3abbf510525ef1b1ed98e99d8c53fc6",
      "text": "不用那么客气啦！那我就先告辞了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_a:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee2b728e137e0c3e882f7a017c66be6e29baa3db6d38f1a2a9ec932419639283",
      "text": "（听说他们两个想看偶像演唱会的时候，\n虽然吓了一跳……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_a:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bcfefab3574d4c714128cad60f73d927d5fb0f1d681a2eb16cc904237e077fa",
      "text": "（但肯定是有什么很厉害的理由吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e01f024d6de5a8b00fc3d9079a18f2b29e78eb884579737a0b22da2e4d6c72b",
      "text": "没想到身边就有偶像粉丝啊。\n问问看果然是对的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36de8f0300e29e1f974abbea3c0648c94b2189ff5e5873952a8ea1b998c6a272",
      "text": "是啊！\n多亏了那家伙的姐姐喜欢偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a4e04737c67257c0708b1cde9cbe9ba4411d4a55efcf9ccc1531bb6f0b58042",
      "text": "既然持有两份一模一样的东西，\n看来是相当狂热的粉丝吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95caaa7e19ddb6d0ab8cc4be2e5dd31eecab801e5ee70cb00e905ac246dc308e",
      "text": "说明这个偶像有这么大的魅力吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3aeba3eb47e164fe66bc4b887d192a72389807f9ff8f2cee3c4af05c031dbb2",
      "text": "咕～真想快点看看有多厉害！\n学校能不能快点放学啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb2c2d2b0f17bb1f75effe301ac2538ae7f9e8943b307383e9bbba6b70efc315",
      "text": "唱歌和跳舞也得好好看。试镜的时候，\n不是说我们可能也得表演吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5aff382872c84f86cba0f12110ce02f5dc818465a6387196c064c19c9d36e5a",
      "text": "噢！看这个好好学习一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e467ed65a61d42fdb1915f1b0dca57d9d60dffcba057185232c38acc60c4c13b",
      "text": "嗯。粉骨碎身，\n大干一场吧，相棒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377",
      "text": "噢——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a773f0afb2dec2a756d7f806ba50e24ff13f113c1c51b6b575bf2a24cbc08787",
      "text": "玄武家·客厅",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b82b1dd59d58f475d949d242ab5fe372cd4d1fb1081e781c066211f07332e9f",
      "text": "（有言实行。就像对相棒说的那样，\n我一定会通过偶像试镜给他们看）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ae715aac7c0c733ae5ca5e844bb7c9be349ca5f344fe3f286bdb66e971a6b14",
      "text": "好大的场地啊。\n……坐在最后面的家伙能看得清吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9231754e64a3e151dfa97cea39620c2bab1e23443c36f5d1eb35179cf2873ddd",
      "text": "（……好华丽的登场。服装也相当显眼。\n听到欢呼声了。到底有多厉害？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb58c8b70f40135047a33f6a081ef859f9e034e02d7a31487cf6e34c4e66c3c6",
      "text": "（粉丝配合歌曲的呼喊和动作都整齐划一）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92dace0c31f588384f9afc862b06607e8594a718fbca0e97ae1bd610345f82f7",
      "text": "（这些偶像，\n统率着这么庞大数量的粉丝吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff87a42d808b10ba57f7dba68a9a540d0e90eb7d0d4f465f00953c41ba954e2e",
      "text": "（离得那么近居然放烟花和火焰！？\n粉丝居然也不害怕……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03aed6758d11e5885277204d56ab98bbb618a8651a0091cf26675975114b8ce1",
      "text": "（不管是偶像还是粉丝，胆子都够大的啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd2cf3dc5b8c50fe0b42b16f64df60e344a5e92eca54f940eb56de0ab739c675",
      "text": "所谓的偶像，是远远超出我想象的\n了不得的存在啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:998ae0176332896f2d591e274fd4002d4a01756c60644184f87208d9779af506",
      "text": "……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2761c9b5c8db564a421f1092141880a22fa68f5925a6ce7d54ea351903b4049",
      "text": "最后一排的大家也请接好哦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3aade5b372e737d1c72b5ea23ef14473e0984109685f6c9c6010db894eba81b1",
      "text": "刚才的飞吻，好像连最后一排都传达到了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd045973b47c7defc524df7c0c2e48cd694668d97440e495607b1d5b49b976fe",
      "text": "（虽然隐约能猜到，\n但偶像还真是个轻浮的职业啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_c:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c0f392d8dc01f8a21adac45471c196e2aa99851e7f25b0332f54cfd500ff7a",
      "text": "……不，仅凭这个下判断还为时尚早。\n结论等全部看完再下也不迟。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_d:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c96f98dd087046c48cffb500dbf7849f9c1c24b449060c74f883dd7eba90686",
      "text": "看完演唱会DVD后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_d:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3880037d8c82b7bd17f3ef12f769766094bcb0280ae0099500932017a06b349c",
      "text": "偶像的演唱会，比想象中要炽热得多啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebfddbdc15bdee7d6f2e91493e02808fa2476e0f6d9504787d7ad1e7b1182b6b",
      "text": "虽然也有轻浮的地方，\n但在该帅气的时候，确实帅得很彻底。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13c1b0def76e0db47234882558adfaa2a32b302ec457fb984535ad8b1ba59650",
      "text": "（演出时间大概两小时左右吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ff31a488ee332cdc6a5a4cb8ab28c424f8f07fd12382558c934b525789faf3d",
      "text": "（在这期间几乎不间断地又唱又跳，\n没有体力是绝对撑不下来的吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3594b34464593a39e01a3628d095d11e9b567ec70004067a2095e15780240ced",
      "text": "（在前后的舞台之间来回奔跑了好几次。\n而且中途还要边跑边唱，负担更重了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_d:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bd0f0ca36577404ad42b26c8a4bf4ade16e199ddf2f1fa077bdda9e0118d3d5",
      "text": "好了，接下来看看特典吧。\n开始期待会是什么内容了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bfbc296f01857badd73936bd83cf7e743713095c55951f02ab9bebff7e9a632",
      "text": "我们从前半部分的歌单整体过一遍开始。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9ffd7e953c039193c708ca60a546a84067565c1c4cba0f421b0269d438cd47a",
      "text": "这是……直到演出当天的贴身跟拍吗。\n能看到幕后花絮可真是帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d23b34af75dbdd6772deb9e0801707ce934056667a62a1c21fc586c543562df8",
      "text": "到底要经过多少练习，才能完成那样的舞台，\n看来能从中找到了解的线索了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_e:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb504a9413eb7ea7fba8ba01f3ed742a80a07d5f65fbb712355622b264eb23ce",
      "text": "哈啊、哈啊……不好意思，\n请从头再来一次！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8140d9ee36b65271b9d06b641f70797ccfdf307d42bb6e254d05dd839d0fe4bf",
      "text": "（……真了不起的家伙。毫不妥协，死咬着不放。\n和演唱会上不同的一面，哪怕姿态狼狈……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9433030d28da1cce98873bb39e5968219fdd124739e3d0f7861b697f088e9fda",
      "text": "（脑子里只想着让粉丝高兴，\n以及让演唱会成功）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d5f7ab8801af997b56ad62c64521981a51f898190fc40f8a124ed0692deb6ab",
      "text": "（演唱会上说过的那些话，每一句的份量都加重了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1728619fff4af09fbcadc568b388ffcd5dcab6cbc76163461e3790cee79e5db8",
      "text": "（看了这个便一目了然。偶像只有时刻努力、\n不断向上攀登的人才能当得起！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c1a80d62d19375662b96ffd224e6d5935a99c2792c50763b1cf5aef6a6ef3bb",
      "text": "（让我见识到了真正男儿的帅气）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:335c3324462354b4c7b5471c3a19060d0c8990adda86816067eb0e5924a13974",
      "text": "如果能通过315 Production的试镜，\n我也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:710b6e9280ffef58ae60cdd3ff565d337d387ed155e7fe7e9dc2755cf972c1fb",
      "text": "我们也会变成这样吗。\n感觉不赖。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07af0c9a4cd692d36f59e567e985937d43d0c7e4ad24aa35049631bd8ffc8c13",
      "text": "话虽如此……\n我居然为了以偶像为目标而在学习啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_e:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05612d263bab0cee21feddf53c01f2a88ab6b95d0df07be35c5a1888b969e5d5",
      "text": "呵，自从遇见朱雀之后，\n出乎意料的事还真是一桩接一桩啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_f:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57a5677bb622a8c6358f1366e1c8b394fb039ac527e934c50768c1ad54acdacf",
      "text": "几年前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3eb9c8dfde08ba519aad343319f6466615a658a61861207d8cc07eee48c57bb4",
      "text": "（修眼镜居然要花好几个小时。\n虽然只有一会儿，但也真够不方便的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_f:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:805e3965c553e9dd932b8c5d4e1a322882b003f00939801a6009b8211831d64d",
      "text": "（趁这个机会，把配副备用眼镜也考虑进去吧。\n……总之，得先跟老爹联络一下才行）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_f:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0437fb66dd4e9daa5e6403efa060bb64fb52ba34bf63ffd886900f936ceb0594",
      "text": "（说起来，那边现在是几点？\n可不能半夜打电话过去）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f6aa51a4135ae4a531e64225c63a3476678681e73f6e74659bd157282008656",
      "text": "（那边摆着的是长凳吗？\n隔着距离看过去模模糊糊的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_f:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1218e4a79e2bc52381c4546844ed9207454e98aeef10a4195742b54bcdfd66a5",
      "text": "啧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_f:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b39ff401ea5b2635b9a8a0b866851dc2af8d7f01425a64f69981e19f725af3cc",
      "text": "臭小子，刚才看你一直在瞪我们，\n现在居然还敢咂舌，胆子挺肥的嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_f:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f08669e4b5fb612c53d5292eca89b30e0126d11bd8df1c92d862e8d953b43959",
      "text": "看着像个初中生啊。哪个初中的！？\n喂，少在那装没听见！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_f:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74a0b02ea95a533ba1837c086f3d8a265be50f87ff85a796f2b5248edc82d909",
      "text": "……是在说我吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_f:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bb4c549ba38fb75574449984456ed36323d3b7dcf535f270f07f331b3a9425f",
      "text": "（……脸看不太清，是高中生吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_f:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b084b6fe923635d5b1fa4f7d297f9bb9f99a0a5621905110defdde80c6d2528",
      "text": "除了你还有谁啊！\n喂！给我过来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_g:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fddc885accf06f5643e9984200cca281a221fa5c6fbdce93afd13b327d965179",
      "text": "别以为个子高，\n就能在那得意忘形啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:839bbc0d85857bf209ef89a7a610cdb9bdc4322f82e8a07fd568d837c5eefdd7",
      "text": "等等，我都说了是误会吧。\n我刚才并不是在瞪你们……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_g:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0797698ae39ccfa9bfe9cd1ff11f12580c4ca2d1442deca73b17f4555d0e4b42",
      "text": "啰里吧嗦烦死了！\n还没被揍够是吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_g:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:119dea6104ce8da6032ed1813747e8e41cc2adc4ff8c9ee6f1e5d0511cab2748",
      "text": "（完全上头了，看来根本没法沟通）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_g:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1969e45a5d8509f5ae0c871c121ff1bd2419a67e2c9d9de654f3f6adab5a35fb",
      "text": "（就算抛开和高中生的体格差不谈，\n对方人数也太多了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_g:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27eed7c58ebbb6c6028c81e10fd7be78b0c01bc2d77d6681c7718a3cce2585a5",
      "text": "（但是，绝不能坐以待毙！\n就算是误会，既然找上门来了我就奉陪到底！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_g:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af5812165b2398276dbd829a57696363ac8f92d8138096f256936c5d2c61e673",
      "text": "你那是什么眼神？\n想打是吧混账，来啊正合我意！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_g:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bf0294c2b0d14f8816a691276389c2f948d946f58fcd86237267e3e21e7c02c",
      "text": "给我等一——下！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_g:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3eb2350ab2b7e9290a45052fc14dab2e2167705be9042bd4568b3e122bb86cef",
      "text": "啊！？在哪呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_g:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93c1e75f90592bb71b10b12d19a8a5b35406fde0f4a3879de08f3e594bcbaf3f",
      "text": "喂，在那边！在攀爬架上面！\n臭小子，给我滚下来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_g:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b235ae00aa5994498d2267660231d51f408cd69776b8042d26098bdf8a6e730",
      "text": "三个人围着揍一个，\n哪边是坏人一眼就能看出来吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_g:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b89240d283117171e91e7812fef1222cdd8e5a36248bdc6818df5fd899bcdbb",
      "text": "喂，那边那个。我来帮你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_h:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:329b45cb19cd7f6739deff00854fb54bd88a0e9d3535b36296a3b735f599097a",
      "text": "十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_h:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:492d93197d08093d3523edf59db94e4796c55be0f280e493918490ab579f2f95",
      "text": "好痛痛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_h:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:110764bc95c26ac14e2a5c76067481b5bc47b2099794f365709ce1d1aed11954",
      "text": "我刚才都听到了。\n你为什么要瞪那些高中生啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_h:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:844c13d10a2bbb0d93d479cb242124a99347c571094481bbf3dcdfd6b11edb81",
      "text": "没有，单纯是因为没戴眼镜，\n把眼睛眯起来了而已……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_h:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cd23d5952232bbd8562c1c3c723322cdeb56c7cdff06f812b8855c086e95155",
      "text": "真的假的……那不就是纯找茬嘛。\n你可真倒霉啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_h:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f4f8827970114c51cc7bd78f4f36cf0e038ad974f41e08a43e0827eeb1d38b4",
      "text": "你才是。\n为什么要帮素不相识的我啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_h:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9447c1434c70671b0c59cb9d8c8a497dd7f78ec488aa8bc0cec328039ccfd882",
      "text": "看到有人被坏蛋包围，\n当然要去帮忙啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_h:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f9fca14851e016942e2489422f774492b8713ecd19dfcda264b7138f146260d",
      "text": "你刚才一个人也打算跟高中生对着干吧。\n……很有骨气嘛，你这家伙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_h:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07a4251a07fb14f72a8a03c27fe109707b438f43afaa05970b9b82acf0230fef",
      "text": "你刚才也很帅气啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_h:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2dd919272092b4f02298c56fee9c147e524aa0a16f2399576f7646fdc2b7b84d",
      "text": "……呵，虽说我们输了就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_h:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34eb53431e1e80ca3ab84fef8e8483a070116efdc7d70bb57c9c9ed39e277212",
      "text": "是啊，被揍得鼻青脸肿呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_h:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5c17010aeb18c47070ebcc9d2d6b0b91e5b991c2185d0601dff318a6ee85796",
      "text": "说起来，还没问你名字呢！\n我叫红井朱雀！初三！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_h:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21e0c6b174e1d3f22896870291e352a7e5793ffe07c2067d48a81e491ce4b4fd",
      "text": "然后，这家伙是喵喜威。\n我都叫它喵子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_h:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5d0765a37d210f766c76b197a95148a35ad17d33c4c6123cc2aaea2ce131bd1",
      "text": "喵喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_h:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe96b413c808e95399e2f3f7b7ae5316c11dbd0893c1e10e51247cbaaa03bbe1",
      "text": "……这样啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_h:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25f1636ce4121ec82999eb41612a9cf17f2d9d0799684510837f24153e215863",
      "text": "怎么往那边跑啊？\n算了，无所谓啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_h:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:749da9da33084379379782d9779df299a31807f7d0a34c6634e1aebed9e5f66e",
      "text": "话说，你叫什么名字啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_i:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de38890ef529fbeebfdebd5b0f949a46071e1801ca149d209ce93b7b5414a3f7",
      "text": "我叫黑野玄武。\n同样也是初……阿嚏！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_i:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a12a6cce6d7609e7627aeb2b6e03a99a7d576d42348731958862ddf98799aad",
      "text": "喂喂，怎么了？冷吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_i:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68413581afa59b0883b6d7cd47f5bf1cbae85b417bb7d7c9ae8cb49078e693f3",
      "text": "没……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_i:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60ce5f7e4e8db767e60b81531fa1d8ef159476b4f3b89fe1e18790ed7d7bbf8d",
      "text": "不好意思，其实我对猫过敏。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_i:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56090e85e49c2a57887429eff015f98ef5c59c3d32566e6bb2a1d964e42940a7",
      "text": "只要不靠太近或者不在下风口就没事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_i:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0076a02c487184f373adb3a8c1b225b40c5ce13b4c0df0588300cbf07d6a24ab",
      "text": "原来是这样啊！\n喵子，可别往玄武那边凑哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_i:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c0bda19421b8ca2f226c1686ff5f14a35a5a4ab558cbaa9c050a909137047f",
      "text": "喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_i:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5092f259633dc85cb766841808a4a0c2cf16343d6fcc4ce10c93604c7f1b1b20",
      "text": "重新介绍一下，我是黑野玄武。\n同样也是初三。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_i:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b7ff3c2e9c4319682353deedc8deeaa634c79268887cf94e6237fa478dfe6e0",
      "text": "哦，同一年级啊。\n真巧啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_i:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83d425bf64f13915dd3e5931ea1500c4eea08495a7d057be99683ae51d0becd6",
      "text": "这也是某种缘分吧。\n请多指教啦，玄武！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_i:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25fc93faf35b27a1ff6073a5dbadb2f74d7eeb2de813843c6fa2b778def8e40f",
      "text": "嗯，我这边也是，请多指教了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_j:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:456733f3dcbfa8f3883d40773e60f2661e37226fbae9af87f3f6fca4025f23fa",
      "text": "……想起了怀念的事啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9896b3e6fda8f4b002b4c0c7885c25facce40a832cc780eedc9b11eda9de6a0b",
      "text": "（好了，稍微休息一下，再看一遍演唱会吧。\n这次要重点看唱歌和舞蹈……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_j:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e703c52b6f2654c34abdca947c4b4261d1e819ad62fac6865a0eb31b7e85612",
      "text": "LINK？是朱雀来的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:947fabae7c8a714c5f8526b4f145819f49fd15556374795255e186e7f3766b12",
      "text": "……看来那家伙也看完了。\n打个电话过去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_j:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4b08d41cbff1347c43ecb5a61eebf70ded0d0910336a79853d7ca0c0669953c",
      "text": "噢，玄武！你看LINK了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_j:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6578b15244cd360c42983ecc3bc70c00e05569275e5c0f2575936e6277f62ba8",
      "text": "嗯，所以才打过来的。我也刚好把演唱会和\n特典都看完了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_j:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4867b678d295f2ff348869b192fa39343965b77837aeb6bcd1e3c36ac19fc3e7",
      "text": "那现在能见个面吗？\n我有好多话想跟你说啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_j:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc7755c4fcd1a185464fe5e02017fee3ede8f289ef706229ff8ed5388b3024d0",
      "text": "也想听听玄武的感想啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:838992796f20f4c854fcd361ab399e4df855501b12164e1c888a29ce453f733c",
      "text": "呵，好啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_j:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db478b6f63511bf98f8ca15b25133a3e37b942af2d98e88455b1f1dcd15e61ae",
      "text": "太好啦！那在哪碰头？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_j:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:921b69446562ecc303bf08b86af017407d474c164a3103eeb935950f5ebfcd75",
      "text": "这个嘛……\n就去我们第一次见面的那个公园吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_j:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:722b03682699608fbfe9a12e8cfe7f4699727e1fb8fc6d020e1da5cc4876f0f2",
      "text": "那里啊，知道了！我现在就骑车过去！\n到了再联络！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_03_1_1_009_03:1_1_009_03_j:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:328a707952c9659f4bddc62001630ad2a7a882c968b31966f6f4ed526717d4eb",
      "text": "知道了。我也马上过去。\n待会儿见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
